@startuml
title Sequence — teacher creates quiz (19 Nov 2026)
actor Teacher
participant "React Teacher Workspace" as UI
participant "Express Quiz Router" as API
participant "JWT / role middleware" as Auth
participant "Prisma Client" as ORM
database SQLite
Teacher -> UI : Enter title, duration, instructions, questions
UI -> API : POST /api/quizzes + Bearer JWT
API -> Auth : Verify token and teacher/admin role
Auth --> API : Authenticated principal
API -> API : Validate quiz fields and options
API -> ORM : Create quiz and question records
ORM -> SQLite : Insert related rows
SQLite --> ORM : Persisted records
ORM --> API : Created quiz
API --> UI : 201 Created + quiz data
UI --> Teacher : Show quiz in management list
@enduml
